@{
    Layout = null;
}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>PMM · 离线工程基座</title>
    <style>
        :root { color-scheme: light dark; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }
        body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; background: #101820; color: #eef4f6; }
        main { max-width: 42rem; margin: 2rem; padding: 3rem; border: 1px solid #33434d; border-radius: 1rem; }
        .label { color: #8cddd0; font-size: .8rem; letter-spacing: .15em; }
        h1 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 3rem); margin-block: 1rem; }
        p { line-height: 1.7; color: #c1d0d7; }
        code { color: #8cddd0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main>
        <span class="label">PERSONAL MEDIA MANAGER · FOUNDATION</span>
        <h1>全新离线工程基座</h1>
        <p>这个惯性 Razor 页面只用于验证单一 Kestrel 宿主。业务功能尚未实现，也不会读取媒体、创建账户、启动后台任务或连接外部服务。</p>
        <p lang="en">Fresh offline foundation. Business operations are disabled. Only this read-only shell and <code>/health</code> are available.</p>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
